Try It Here
&lt;/h2&gt;

&lt;p&gt;👉 &lt;a href="https://www.reactchallenges.com/challenges/play-soroban" rel="noopener noreferrer"&gt;Play Soroban Challenge&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

